# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Site configuration — environment overrides
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# Only `NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL` overrides site.config.ts. All other identity
# fields (name, description, author, social, repoUrl) are baked at build time.
#
# Per-environment recommendations:
#   - local dev: leave unset, falls back to site.config.ts value
#   - Vercel preview: set to the auto-generated preview URL
#   - production: set to the canonical https:// domain
#
# Architecture decision: docs/architecture/2026-07-29-site-config-design.md
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Canonical site URL. Must include protocol. Trailing slashes are stripped.
# Example: NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://example.com
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=